}

// MemberChange is a change to a membership: the member gets Role, or is removed when Remove is set.
type MemberChange struct {
	Role   Role
	Remove bool
}

// ChangeMember applies change to a member of an organization. When allow is not nil it sees the member as they are, and
// the number of owners the organization has, and may refuse with false (ErrForbidden). Both run under the store's lock,
// so no other change can come between the check and this one. allow must not call the store. The organization always keeps
// an owner: a change that would leave none is refused with ErrLastOwner. It returns the member after a role change, and
